{"minVersion":"0.4","class":"DepictionTabView","tintColor":"#27BEF5","headerImage":"https://apt.mjh.im/assets/im.mjh.xianyuadblock/banner.png","tabs":[{"tabname":"详情","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"**临时提示**\n\n巨魔注入环境可能会导致 App 卡死、闪退，建议使用越狱环境，或降级使用 3.0.0 版本。","useMargins":true,"useSpacing":true},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","text":"下载 3.0.0 旧版（arm64）","action":"https://apt.mjh.im/pkg/3af6dd88273d/im.mjh.xianyuadblock_3.0.0_iphoneos-arm64.deb","openExternal":true},{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://xianyu.goforit.si/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/xianyu","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"闲鱼广告与页面净化、自动好评与商品任务、虚拟商品交付、配置迁移及运行记录。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"## 广告与页面净化\n- 去除冷启动开屏广告\n- 去除切后台再回前台的热启动广告\n- 过滤搜索结果中的淘宝广告商品\n- 隐藏「我的」页面「闲鱼回收」卡片\n\n## 商品与日常任务\n\n- 自动翻新在售商品，今日已完成时跳过\n- 自动领取会员经验，已领取时跳过\n- 自动普通擦亮，今日已擦亮时跳过\n- 卖家、买家自动好评，评价文案与执行间隔可调\n\n## 虚拟商品交付\n\n- 按商品配置自动检查订单并交付\n- 支持固定文本、卡密与接口交付\n- 卡密导入、库存与交付记录\n\n## 配置管理\n\n- 导出、导入与清空插件配置\n- 配置可经加密文件或剪贴板迁移\n\n## 关注开发者\n\n- 首次进入助手可自愿关注开发者\n- 跳过或关注失败都不影响功能\n\n## 任务控制与运行记录\n\n- 显示任务总数、当前数量、成功、失败与跳过数量\n- 支持暂停、继续、终止、重新开始和失败重试\n- 按商品短标题查看成功、失败与跳过记录\n- 商品运行记录支持结果筛选、按日期分组、清空历史和分页查看\n- 擦亮与会员经验显示当日状态，记录支持日期分组和一键清空\n- 固定高度的近期日志，可独立滚动\n\n## 使用入口\n\n- 「我的」页顶部助手入口\n- 插件源与官网入口\n\n支持 iOS 15.0 以上。","useSpacing":true,"useMargins":true}]},{"tabname":"更新日志","class":"DepictionStackView","views":[{"class":"DepictionStackView","orientation":"landscape","xPadding":8,"views":[{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://xianyu.goforit.si/","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"插件官网","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://pingme.pm/xianyu","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"提交反馈","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}},{"class":"DepictionButtonView","action":"https://qr.alipay.com/fkx180736inoxop5mkbqh83?_s=web-other","openExternal":true,"tintColor":"#e9f3ff","yPadding":4,"view":{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"赏杯咖啡","fontSize":13,"fontWeight":"medium","textColor":"#335d86","alignment":1,"useMargins":false,"usePadding":false}}]},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 3.1.2+2","text":"2026-10-18"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"1、自动发货关闭时不再随启动接入聊天观测。  \n2、发货进度条默认关闭，需手动开启。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 3.1.1","text":"2026-10-17"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"1、修复部分注入环境下启动闪退或卡死。  \n2、修复安装时出现的解包警告。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 3.1.0","text":"2026-10-17"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"1、新增卖家、买家自动好评，可分别设置评价文案和执行间隔。  \n2、新增虚拟商品交付：按商品配置自动发货，支持卡密导入与交付记录。  \n3、新增配置导出、导入与清空，配置可经加密文件或剪贴板迁移。  \n4、翻新商品、会员经验、普通擦亮改为独立任务，可分别检查、暂停和查看记录。  \n5、自动任务可分别设置执行间隔。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 3.0.0","text":"2026-10-07"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"1、新增后台原样编辑商品，今日已完成的商品自动跳过。  \n2、新增会员经验自动领取与普通擦亮开关。  \n3、新增任务数量统计、暂停、继续、终止、重新开始与失败重试。  \n4、新增带商品短标题的运行记录、结果筛选、日期分组、清空历史与分页浏览。  \n5、新增「闲鱼回收」卡片隐藏开关。  \n6、新增「我的」页顶部助手入口，以及版本、官网和插件源信息。  \n7、新增官网与 Rootless、RootHide 安装包下载入口。"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 2.0","text":"2026-09-21"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"1、新增拦截「切后台再回前台」时弹出的启动广告  \n2、更名为「闲鱼去广告助手」，包名同步变更（旧版会被替换）"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 1.0.0","text":"2026-06-14"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"首个版本：去除开屏广告，过滤搜索结果中的淘宝广告商品"}]}]}
